":1,"text":"Fagioli was first back over the start line with a 100m lead, having completed the first lap in 4m36s (143.5 km/h).","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":1,"text":"Both Felix and Sommer had problems with their engines and turned into the pit, Sommer retired on the spot.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":12},{"lap":3,"text":"Etancelin did not give up but managed during the next laps to close in on Fagioli and actually come up beside him once.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":4},{"lap":4,"text":"On the fourth lap Fagioli put his foot down and started to pull away despite Etancelin's best effort to keep in touch.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":5,"text":"After five laps Fagioli was leading Etancelin by 9 seconds. Wimille was 18 seconds behind, Moll 24 and von Waldthausen 31 seconds. Meanwhile Gaupillat had retired.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":6,"text":"Zehender, who had started from the back of the grid was making excellent progress and was third behind Etancelin.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":7,"text":"Zehender spins and stalls; a spectator pushes the car and Zehender is disqualified.","q":false,"c":10},{"lap":10,"text":"Lehoux falls back with gearbox trouble, pits and loses a lap.","q":false,"c":7},{"lap":12,"text":"Fagioli laps in 4m29s and keeps pulling away from Etancelin.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":13,"text":"Fagioli eases off to hold his gap to Etancelin.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":16,"text":"Count Czaykowski retired with engine troubles as did Whitney Straight and Lazlo Hartmann. Pierre F\u00e9lix was out of the race as well.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":22,"text":"On the 22th lap Etancelin and Wimille came in together. Wimille was fast away but Etancelin's Monza refused to start.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":22,"text":"For five minutes Etancelin struggled before he finally was able to return to the race, having dropped to fifth position and losing a lap to Fagioli.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":4},{"lap":25,"text":"Fagioli was leading by several kilometres from Wimille, who had now taken over second position, ahead of Moll.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":33,"text":"A light rain starts to fall.","q":false},{"lap":35,"text":"Fagioli wins from Wimille and Moll; von Waldthausen is fourth, a lap down, Etancelin fifth.","q":false,"c":0}]}